		{"id":"1ffecb7d1661528f","type":"text","text":"Cloud shape modeling:\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8vZcrrJQLII\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z3vjJiNBYlg\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-aTwkDn3wpE","x":-3332,"y":6165,"width":510,"height":148},
		{"id":"15738d3042d1ea73","type":"text","text":"Example 1: (file: VolumeMorphing)\n* Use Cloud Shape Generate for geometry shape of a cloud\n* Use VDB to convert polygon geometry to voxel (density)\n\t* Use Cloud noise for adding details\n* Use VDB to convert polygon geometry to SDF\n* Use VDB to perform SDF morphing\n* Use VDB to convert SDF to voxels","x":-5960,"y":6057,"width":520,"height":243},
